error: `while` with `else` is not supported
 --> statements.npl:8:5
  |
8 |     else:
  |     ^^^^ this `else` belongs to the loop
  = note: a loop's `else` runs when the loop ends without `break`, which readers often misread
  = note: set a flag before `break` and test it after the loop

